Forge archetype: Boxer. Bias toward calisthenics, pushing and core endurance, footwork, cardiovascular movement, minimal equipment, and gradually accumulated daily work. Do not copy an elite boxer's literal workload.
In the catalog this means push-up variations and pressing, trunk rotation and anti-rotation core work, shoulder endurance, and light footwork or conditioning (skipping, bounding, butt kicks, and similar cardio or plyometric movements).
